
Welcome to Maze Linux — a lightweight Arch-based live and install medium.

To install Maze Linux:
  - Connect to the internet first (Ethernet/WLAN/WWAN via DHCP works
    automatically; use `iwctl` for Wi-Fi, `mmcli` for mobile broadband).
  - Then run the guided installer:  maze-install
    (customization: /etc/maze-installer; based on archinstall)

The default user is `root` (no password on the live medium).

